*
*******************************************
*
*PTVS3V3P1UP
*
*NXP Semiconductors
*
*400 W Transient Voltage Suppressor 
* 
*VCL  = 8V      @ IPPM = 75A
*VBR  = 6V      @ IR   = 10mA
*IRM  = 5µA     @ VRWM = 3,3V
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*Package pinning does not match Spice model pinning.
*Package: SOD128
*
*Package Pin 1: cathode
*Package Pin 2: anode
*
*
*
*
*Simulator: SPICE2
*
*******************************************
*#
.SUBCKT PTVS3V3P1UP 1 2
* 
*The resistor R1 and the diode D2 do not  reflect physical *devices but improve only modeling in the reverse mode of *operation.
*   
R1 1 2 1E+010   
D1 1 2 DIODE1 
D2 1 2 DIODE2
*
 .MODEL DIODE1 D 
 + IS = 1E-014   
 + N = 0.98      
 + BV = 5.504    
 + IBV = 8.686E-006      
 + RS = 0.01     
 + CJO = 4.84E-009       
 + VJ = 0.88     
 + M = 0.378     
 + FC = 0
 + TT = 0
 + EG = 1.1      
 + XTI = 3       
 .MODEL DIODE2 D 
 + IS = 1E-016   
 + N = 1.04      
 + RS = 100      
 .ENDS
*

